I've found that looking at tatoeba.org , I have had questions about
translations, both how to translate something and why was something
translated like this.  I have felt that posting such questions to either of
these two groups would have been distracting/derailing, so I have created a
group for the purpose of asking questions about translations, mostly from
tatoeba, and mostly in English.

http://groups.google.com/group/tatoeba-lojban

